From 604513105ee814ef7f2ee709cfcc1a333c84635b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Mon, 30 Nov 2020 13:20:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Limit basket item quantity and pass cancellation tokens
 through BasketService

- Cap quantity per catalog item at Basket.MaxQuantityPerItem
- Validate quantities in AddItemToBasket and BasketItem.SetQuantity
- Propagate CancellationToken to repository calls
- Use structured logging when updating quantities
- Extract GetBasketWithItemsAsync helper
---
