 .../Entities/BasketAggregate/BasketItem.cs    |  4 +-
 .../Interfaces/IBasketService.cs              | 11 +--
 src/ApplicationCore/Services/BasketService.cs | 69 ++++++++++++-------
 4 files changed, 77 insertions(+), 45 deletions(-)

